Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's battle will\Nbe the final showdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be launching a surprise\Nattack from the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the Fortified City's forces\Nslow down the Combined Stratum Lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.48,0:00:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll send the signal for us to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that about sum it all up, Hayachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep. Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Guardian will certainly be able\Nto keep the Stratum Lords busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for how, you'll just\Nhave to wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sure have a lot of faith\Nin this guardian of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we should believe in him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.86,0:00:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once the Netherlord shows\Nhis ugly mug, that'll be our cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when we strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be up to us to get rid of\Nthe Netherlord once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anyone have anything\Nthey'd like to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got something I've been\Nwanting to get off my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We surrendered ourselves to\Nthe Netherlord once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.42,0:00:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For that, we should have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you from the bottom\Nof my heart for taking us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:01:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if this battle's the end of the\Nline for us, I've got no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.64,0:01:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.94,0:01:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our son's curse has been lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing more I could ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.03,0:01:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get that you guys are pumped about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,0:01:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We definitely don't have\Nany plans to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.48,0:01:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Akka?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.44,0:01:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm dying before I get a\Ngirlfriend and we make out sloppy style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You getting worked up for something so\Npathetic makes me ashamed to be your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't pay those fools any mind,\NKai. You have me. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll burn bright until we burn out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.30,0:01:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't burning out mean you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain's right, but we\Nshould try to come back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just assume we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I suppose we should just do\Nwhat we always do then. Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to be around to watch our\Ngranddaughter grow up, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.66,0:01:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would follow Master Boxo anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it meant marching\Nstraight into Hell itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:01:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We vow to stand steadfast\Nby the Guardian's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Usatta? Ussarina?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.82,0:02:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone gets hurt, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll patch you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the Director on our side, as\Nlong as you're still breathing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll be back in the fight in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be firing a ton of arrows,\Nso I don't want anyone getting hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Pity will do her best. Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for me, I'll be driving an A-car around\Nwith Shui and the director on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you get hurt, I'll pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.64,0:02:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is it just me or is\Nsomething coming this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec, that's Botan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's got people in tow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness, I thought that was it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, you were a huge help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been far too long\Nsince I prayed to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Director Bear, Hevee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.22,0:02:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought both of you were\Nat the Fortified City.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the final showdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of hiding away in the city,\Nwe wanted to fight beside you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, you would have run\Ninto trouble without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were fine. Right, Akka?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right, Shiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd even forgotten that you weren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got the director by\Nmy side, so I'm good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.14,0:03:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Team Boxxo is finally all back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I was gonna say something,\Nbut I totally forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's do our best, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody's full of determination!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're plenty enthused!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left is for the\Nfinal showdown to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner, Lamas!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.71,0:03:59.76,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:03:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you? I mean to get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going in to almost as a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to stop by listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you want to learn both of us.\NBe able to do some of our tasks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you don't know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.69,0:04:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the laughs? Driving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.61,0:04:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have your sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so strict!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so strict!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.07,0:04:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.89,0:04:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the ultimate!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.99,0:05:10.41,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,434)\fscx65\pos(477,56.4)}To the Final Showdown
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.02,0:05:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The destined day has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our job today is to thin out\Nthat tidal wave of monsters and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.74,0:05:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then defeat the huge frankenfreak\Nof stratum lord thingies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.10,0:05:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This spot looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up to all the\Nlife forms in the soil?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to harsh your buzz\Nand jam myself in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to have a little\Nchat with you if that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to interrupt, but\Nis this really necessary, Field?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't actually have any\Nproof that it does anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it feels easier to\Nmanipulate the soil when I do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned something new today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth is, it's a mystery to me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just kind of feel my\Nway through this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.63,0:05:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have the land's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:06:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now I can go as crazy as I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the big fused-up batty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's standing way in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't ask for a more\Nperfect setup in my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to get things started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First I'll surprise them\Nwith a little pit stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a nice trip, see you next fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.44,0:06:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take my time consuming\Nthose monsters later!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad, they're nutrients now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finally decided to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.82,0:06:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out the size of that thing though!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vending machine\Ngang's probably watching
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I might as well put on a show for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is how I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wap-a-chow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, monster, can you smell\Nwhat this field is cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.22,0:07:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My circuits can't handle\Nwhat's happening here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, the ground has arms\Nand legs, and it's fist fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.68,0:07:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt's kind of creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought so too, but I\Ndidn't come out and say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, look at the Guardian go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's as dashing and gallant as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.90,0:07:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I had a feeling that was\NField taking care of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.20,0:07:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I feel kind of\Nsilly for ever stressing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out over being reborn\Nas a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is he making all\Nthose pits appear too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup, that's one of the Guardian's powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.14,0:07:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's another thing Field can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time for gawking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still have a job to do here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fields taken on the Combined\NStratum Lord, Mano Alando.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, he swallowed up a\Nbunch of the little guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.36,0:07:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First things first, we\Nneed to open up a path.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dance, O Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shriek, O' Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:07:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks like my stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's charging it all by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the director is strong, but\Nisn't that a little too reckless?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're staying behind, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone doesn't stop\Nthis horde of monsters here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll get in your way when\Nyou take on the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.44,0:08:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Boxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got this! Kick his butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see them again,\Nwon't we? Hello, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the only one who's anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, you better come back alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to stay focused\Non the task at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even without his army, the\NNetherlord won't be easy to defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They drew a ton of enemies away,\Nbut there are still a ton left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.36,0:08:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be stopping here to\Ngive the Guardian a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.66,0:08:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you the best of luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just like that, she's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.46,0:09:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems my sister is as restless as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure her group will manage just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping everything goes as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's looking this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did cause a big hubbub.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes sense he'd take notice of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your tiresome meddling,\Nmy plans have been foiled again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will pay for your insolence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty obvious from his\Nvoice that he's pissed off at us.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.17,0:09:31.38,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HBEEBEE&\3c&H445E68&\shad0\pos(375,20)}Willow
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.92,0:09:32.71,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (vertical),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H2612B3&\shad0\bord3\pos(30,80)}A Kaleidoscope in the Night Sky
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.55,0:09:32.00,sign_Arial,text (horizontal),0,0,0,,{\3c&H020D96&\an8\bord4\fs12\shad0}Makes 5 types of fiery flowers bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems so angry, I couldn't resist\Nlaunching that to add some flair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flowers of light blooming on\Nthe battlefield is a nice touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now, you continue to mock me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually thought it might calm you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoopsie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.74,0:09:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My loyal servants, heed my call\Nand return from the path to Hades.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:10:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master the power of the Netherlord and\Npunish these fools to defy your master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, those are the\NPinky and Thumb Generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the Forefinger General,\Nbut I defeated him back in the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the Netherlord sacrificed a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bunch of monsters so he\Ncould bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three general class baddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.66,0:10:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Netherlord jumps in\Ntwo, we won't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's time for\Nus to make our move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.18,0:10:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When's the last time we fought together?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been forever in a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Black Band is back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never would have thought we'd get\Na chance to team up like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems long life has its advantages.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of the three generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.20,0:10:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord is all yours. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.12,0:10:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are way too strong for\Nyou to challenge them by yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:10:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should all be fighting together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I can't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Netherlord were to unleash his magic\Nwhile we're in the middle of our battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd all be wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of that, someone needs to fight\Nhim directly, or else we're sure to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows that it's up to seniors\Nlike us to put on the boring opening act.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only right for us to let the\Nnext generation take the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I were 40 years younger,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.86,0:11:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have insisted on battling\Nit out with the Netherlord myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that really brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you were always so\Nhot-blooded back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.66,0:11:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, getting old sucks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One second, you're the main attraction,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in the blink of an\Neye, you're just sidekicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.42,0:11:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.46,0:11:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, I don't need to hear any\Nmore complaining about getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were trying to be considerate,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it seems we were just being\Nrude by worrying too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.80,0:11:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't have to tell me twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're leaving the rest to you, Voxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.62,0:11:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you keep everyone safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.99,0:12:06.99,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20\pos(150,180)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he summoned his generals, the\NNetherlord probably used up a bunch of mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.46,0:12:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Activate Barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The game plan is for\Nme to focus on defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.46,0:12:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and buy time while we wait\Nfor the reinforcements?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the fortified city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging by how strong Field\Nis, the plan should work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing the Netherlord\Nunderstands that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to\Nwaste on you, sorry lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to settle this farce quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.14,0:12:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone's impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, he's skipping his\Nusual routine of belittling us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's created some kind of mini black hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.90,0:13:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, you're wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My darkness sphere sucks everything\Nup into the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for you to resist it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like he found a spell that\Nlets him get past my barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, that's really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do now? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.82,0:13:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.86,0:13:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, we're in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to get bigger that\Nway you won't get sucked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.52,0:14:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try picking me up now nether nerd you\Nmust think you've outsmarted me with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is looking bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything we can do? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.22,0:14:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxxo! Not good. It's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting abducted!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy your\Njourney to the spirit world!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are the others doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:14:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're totally crushing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might as well wrap things up here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chase Bielder!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, time to cook on the\Nfinal dish with maximum destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided to make some rock skewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.26,0:15:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our main ingredient is a big\Nfresh rock in the shape of a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.66,0:15:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the skewer is gonna be yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make a point out of\Nselectively bred burdock roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.62,0:15:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to generations of careful\Nbreeding, I've created this masterpiece?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's even harder than tempered steel.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.58,0:15:39.04,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (top left),0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(45,27)\c&H302D2E&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord1.5\fs31\fad(231,1)}Super-hard
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.58,0:15:39.04,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H302D2E&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord1.5\fs10\pos(148,296)\fad(231,1)}Scientific name
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.58,0:15:39.04,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\an3\c&H302D2E&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord1.5\fs19\pos(596,91)\fad(231,1)}Selective breeding
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I use vines to add a truckload of\Ntorque to the already ultra-heavy tip,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll at least double the skewering power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.00,0:15:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or I think that's what\NI read in a manga once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the spirit world?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.84,0:16:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the\Naftermath of an apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a single living thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place feels so lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to find\Ntasty food to eat in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.90,0:16:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a world devoid of people,\Nthere can be no footwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.78,0:16:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was expecting there to be more of the\NNetherlord's minions running around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.78,0:16:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.22,0:16:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Psst. Uh-oh. Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.66,0:16:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't wait around\Nfor something to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.84,0:16:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry and get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to worry about that, because\Nyou'll all be dead soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.60,0:16:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cooking complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but one of the main\Nreasons you lost is that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you didn't have enough fiber in your diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.68,0:17:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done, Field!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.14,0:17:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you really knocked him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as amazing as ever, Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess Hayachi snuck in at\Nsome point during the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.82,0:17:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have a victory party\Nonce this is all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see Boxxo in the others anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.62,0:17:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the name of that\Nvending machine guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought they were supposed\Nto be fighting the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the heck did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they get magic to weigh somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look there, Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.48,0:17:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as the Netherlord is alive,\Nit looks like it'll keep reviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:18:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one controlling it, so it\Nmakes sense he's got to go down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jace, this is a real pain in the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to take care\Nof this thing first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll leave the Netherlord to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a fellow otherworldly traveler,\NI have faith in you, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You trapped us in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you bother coming in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take this opportunity\Nto finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That magic item in\Nparticular must be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.98,0:18:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't allow something that\Nexceeds my expectations to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.78,0:18:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he followed us in here to make sure\NI was destroyed for good this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that special?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.74,0:18:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if we beat you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll help out everybody else\Nwho's fighting on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's kick the skeleton's bony butt. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.78,0:18:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.26,0:18:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll bury him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be punished for sending me to a\Nworld without a single piece of footwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.08,0:18:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this, I'll sever\Nour cursed connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:19:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I so desired, I could simply\Ncrush you like insects right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.38,0:19:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That portal links back to your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And upon my death, it will become active.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.44,0:19:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should serve as motivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice of him to do that, but who\Nknows if it's just another trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.70,0:19:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys try to keep the Netherlord busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While you're fighting, I'll investigate\Nto see if that portal's legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't waste my time lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I resent the fact that you've\Nthwarted my plans again and again,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.54,0:19:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in my view, it makes you worthy foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of that, you will have the\Ndistinct honor of dying by my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may be an evil skeleton hellbent\Non conquering the whole world,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's never lied to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.90,0:19:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we were to fight here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.82,0:19:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your concern for that woman would\Nkeep you from fully using your powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:19:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Changing things up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.12,0:20:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not hiding behind\Nhostages or traps anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided the best way to defeat you is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to utterly crush you\Nwith overwhelming power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way you won't be able to say you\Nonly lost because of dirty tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, attack me however you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm feeling generous,\NI promise not to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you experience true despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready or not, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wield considerable power,\NBut unfortunately for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.52,0:20:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's not enough to shatter\Nthe barrier of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Considerable power, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.72,0:20:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can tell how strong it was even\Nthough it didn't leave a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can handle\Nthis one through Rolling Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he can see his mana depleting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of like when my points go down\Nwhenever my barrier takes a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.84,0:21:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Standing here and simply taking\Nyour attacks is getting dull.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should have a little bit of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.32,0:21:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget what you said\Nabout not fighting back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless our attacks are actually working?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't flatter yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.66,0:21:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just grown tired of waiting. Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell he's glaring at me with\Nthose beady little light balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.84,0:21:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should cool it with\Nthe taunting for a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.78,0:21:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it's his turn to attack now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll pull through this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And figure out a way to\Nturn the tables on him?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.01,0:22:08.63,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Translation:\N{\fs18.5}Duane Johnson\N{\fs15}Timing:\N{\fs18.5}Edgar Cruz
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.63,0:22:12.60,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Editing:\N{\fs18.5}Alicia Ashby\N{\fs15}Quality Control:\N{\fs18.5}Salem Alabanza
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.76,0:22:17.64,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5\pos(490,15)}Final Quality Control:\N{\fs18.5}Michelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.12,0:23:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.52,0:23:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.84,0:23:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.05,0:23:40.09,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.05,0:23:40.09,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs21\fsp6\fscx100\pos(347.2,294.8)}Dreamworld
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.22,0:23:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

